dre.trinket.ancient_charm.lore=Lord Vatticus: 8% chance to dodge a hit completely.
dre.trinket.ayeraco_wing.lore=Lord Vatticus: The Ayeraco Wing. Press jump again in mid-air and push off the void itself: once in the Overworld, twice in the Twilight worlds. With a carpet, the jumps come first, then the carpet. Ground, water or a ladder give the jumps back. In Vethea, the land of dreams, foreign wings stay silent.
dre.trinket.blast_belt.lore=Lord Vatticus: -75% explosion damage.
dre.trinket.blue_flame.lore=Lord Vatticus: Immune to fire and lava.
dre.trinket.bone_ring.lore=Lord Vatticus: +20% arrow damage, 25% chance to recover the arrow.
dre.trinket.carcinus_shell.lore=Lord Vatticus: 15% chance to reflect a melee hit back at the enemy.
dre.trinket.colossus_pauldron.lore=Lord Vatticus: Like +3 armor, almost no knockback.
dre.trinket.dead_amulet.lore=Lord Vatticus: Below 30% health - Regeneration II (every 30 s), rotten food causes no hunger.
dre.trinket.deep_shell.lore=Lord Vatticus: Breathe twice as long underwater and see in the dark there.
dre.trinket.dramix_seal.lore=Lord Vatticus: Arcana regenerates twice as fast.
dre.trinket.dream_wings_1.lore=Lord Vatticus: The Dreamer's Wings serve only in dreams, in Vethea. Hold jump at a rift and they lift you for about four seconds, and falls will not hurt you. The floor warden lets you up to floor 2.
dre.trinket.dream_wings_2.lore=Lord Vatticus: The Midnight Wings are stronger: about five seconds of lift at a rift, no fall damage. The warden lets you up to floor 3.
dre.trinket.dream_wings_3.lore=Lord Vatticus: The Nightmare Wings are the strongest: about six seconds of lift, no fall damage. The warden lets you to the very top, floor 4. Defeat Lady Luna - and the dream wings serve you awake, in any world.
dre.trinket.dungeon_lamp.lore=Lord Vatticus: Light in Arcana, Arcana mobs deal 15% less damage.
dre.trinket.eternal_ice_ring.lore=Lord Vatticus: 10%: a hit freezes the enemy for a second.
dre.trinket.heart_of_winter.lore=Lord Vatticus: Warm Scarf + Ice Brooch.
dre.trinket.ice_brooch.lore=Lord Vatticus: Immune to slowness, cold builds up a third slower.
dre.trinket.jack_amulet.lore=Lord Vatticus: At night: night vision, +15% damage, enemies do not notice you beyond 8 blocks.
dre.trinket.lich_crown.lore=Lord Vatticus: Every 30 s an absorption shield of 4 hearts.
dre.trinket.magic_carpet.lore=Lord Vatticus: The Ancient Entity's Flying Carpet. Hold jump in mid-air and it keeps your height: about ten seconds in Eden and Wildwood, eight in Apalachia, five in Skythern, three in Mortum. In the ordinary worlds it is weak - about three seconds, until you defeat the Twilight Demon: then ten there too, and in the Twilight worlds it never tires. It will not carry you in a boss arena fight. When it tires, keep holding jump and it lowers you gently. It recovers on the ground, in water or on a ladder.
dre.trinket.master_scabbard.lore=Lord Vatticus: +10% damage with Divine swords.
dre.trinket.parasecta_sting.lore=Lord Vatticus: Immune to poison, your hits poison.
dre.trinket.pharaoh_ankh.lore=Lord Vatticus: Once per 10 minutes saves you from death with half health.
dre.trinket.pocket_magnet.lore=Lord Vatticus: Items within 6 blocks fly to you.
dre.trinket.steadfast_belt.lore=Lord Vatticus: Creeper Tamer Belt + Colossus Pauldron.
dre.trinket.tackle_box.lore=Lord Vatticus: A quarter of bait is not used up.
dre.trinket.tide_armor.lore=Lord Vatticus: Shell of the Deep + Carcinus Shell.
dre.trinket.valor_medal.lore=Lord Vatticus: +10% damage to bosses.
dre.trinket.warm_scarf.lore=Lord Vatticus: Cold builds up half as fast.
dre.trinket.watcher_eye.lore=Lord Vatticus: Immune to blindness and nausea.
dre.trinket.wither_ring.lore=Lord Vatticus: Wither immunity, 20%: your hits wither the enemy.
dre.trinket.ask=Lord Vatticus knows more: sneak and right-click him with the item in hand
