dre.trinket.endless_quiver.desc=Bows shoot without arrows, +10% arrow damage (arrows can't be picked up)
dre.trinket.endless_quiver.lore=Lord Vatticus: The Endless Quiver. Twilight and Iceika archers carry it - sometimes it goes to the victor, and the Eternal Archer always gives up his. While you wear it, any bow shoots without arrows and hits a bit harder - but the arrows you loose are gone.
item.dre.trinket.dust_pouch.name=Dust Pouch
dre.trinket.dust_pouch.desc=Phasers and blitzes shoot without dust, +15% their damage
dre.trinket.dust_pouch.lore=Lord Vatticus: The Dust Pouch. Mages carry it - sometimes it goes to the victor. With it, twilight blitzes and phasers spend no dust and hit harder; without it they burn their world's dust every shot (from the inventory or ammo slots). Infinity on the weapon itself does the same - apply a book on an anvil.
item.dre.trinket.slicer_sling.name=Thrower's Sling
dre.trinket.slicer_sling.desc=A thrown slicer returns to your hand, ricochets one more target
dre.trinket.slicer_sling.lore=Lord Vatticus: The Thrower's Sling. Sorcerers carry it - sometimes it goes to the victor. A slicer thrown with it is back in your hand at once and ricochets one target further.
